msgid ""
"Evaluation numbers should be tracked over time on a fixed benchmark set; a "
"single nDCG@10 = 0.74 is not a claim, but a move from 0.74 to 0.71 after a "
"sync is."
msgstr ""
"评测数字应当在一个固定的基准集上沿时间线追踪；单独一个 nDCG@10 = 0.74 不是什么主张，但一次同步之后从 0.74 变成 0.71 就是了。"

