#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:106
#: 4bd07439bd52468ca63fff997fd89650
msgid ""
"Soft gates are honest warnings, not release blockers. A KB with an S3 "
"warning is still a KB; it just has a reviewer-visible reminder that it is "
"drifting away from its own page-set commitments."
msgstr ""
"软门禁是诚实的警告，不是发布阻塞项。一个带着 S3 警告的知识库仍然是知识库；它只不过多了一条评审者可见的提醒：“你正在偏离自己对页面集合做出的承诺”。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:110
#: a7c52a47b870445aa29ab4857c169f92
msgid "How"
msgstr "How —— 怎么做"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:112
#: d68b3811630c491091f3d6784921dec5
msgid "The gate runner"
msgstr "门禁 runner"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:114
#: 8f8d19c3c69845239c399f83c3c40a9a
msgid ""
"The gate system is a single CI script that runs every check and aggregates "
"results. A minimal implementation:"
msgstr "整个门禁系统就是一个 CI 脚本：逐条跑每项检查并汇总结果。一个最小实现："

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:139
#: d2849605097f485bb6134df04d298883
msgid ""
"Every gate exposes the same interface: a `check()` method that returns `(ok,"
" detail)` and a stable `name`. This lets the CI script stay short — it is "
"the gates themselves that hold the domain knowledge — and lets every gate be"
" tested in isolation."
msgstr ""
"每条门禁都暴露相同的接口：一个返回 `(ok, detail)` 的 `check()` 方法和一个稳定的 `name`。这让 CI 脚本本身很短 ——"
" 领域知识被封装在门禁自身里 —— 并且让每条门禁都可以单独测试。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:144
#: 271cf0673f234ae29caf0f999e1adec3
msgid "The gate report"
msgstr "门禁报告"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:146
#: c7d323382b114fc186aafffaeda87de0
msgid ""
"The output of a gate run is a two-section report: hard failures (if any) "
"followed by soft warnings. The report is Markdown, committed to the build "
"artefacts, and linked from the PR that triggered the build:"
msgstr ""
"一次门禁跑完的输出是一份两段式报告：硬失败（如果有的话）在前，软警告在后。报告是 Markdown 格式的，作为 build artefact "
"落盘，并从触发本次构建的 PR 处链过来："

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:169
#: 077b62b6bb344487b00af2cfa60bcf17
msgid ""
"Hard-failure exit codes block the CI publish step; soft warnings are "
"appended to the PR as a comment so the reviewer sees them without CI going "
"red."
msgstr "硬失败退出码会阻塞 CI 的发布步骤；软警告作为评论追加到 PR 里，这样 CI 不至于红掉，评审者仍然能看到它们。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:173
#: 8e950d64bd654bea91544c5e8c3a94df
msgid "A worked failure"
msgstr "一次具体的失败"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:175
#: 4ff1d06dbe044d84ba1c163a5fc990bf
msgid ""
"Suppose a PR adds a new function to `internal/worker/pool.go` — good faith "
"addition, no rename, no break. The author also edits `architecture.md` to "
"mention the new function and, while there, adds a `<!-- TODO: add diagram "
"-->` marker intending to come back later."
msgstr ""
"假设有一个 PR 往 `internal/worker/pool.go` 里加了一个新函数 —— 诚意新增，无重命名、无破坏性改动。作者顺手编辑了 "
"`architecture.md` 来提到这个新函数，并在那儿加了个 `<!-- TODO: add diagram -->` 标记，打算以后回来补。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:180
#: c9a5947239dd43c1bfb47adcd88a38ca
msgid "Run the gates:"
msgstr "跑一遍门禁："

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:182
#: d5e70c260a57463f8f254fe4d4052352
msgid "**H1 Footer present.** Pass. `architecture.md` has a footer."
msgstr "**H1 Footer 存在。** 通过。`architecture.md` 有 footer。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:183
#: 0755b91fda384d45bdd079b1b43d7013
msgid "**H2 Footer fields valid.** Pass. Fields are well-formed."
msgstr "**H2 Footer 字段合法。** 通过。字段都格式良好。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:184
#: 9b05892eab26474892e5067d0168a9d6
msgid ""
"**H3 AI-approval consistency.** Pass. The author set `updated_by: human`, "
"`review_status: pending`, `review_score: 0`, `reviewed_by:`. Everything "
"consistent."
msgstr ""
"**H3 AI 审批一致性。** 通过。作者设了 `updated_by: human`、`review_status: "
"pending`、`review_score: 0`、`reviewed_by:`。一切自洽。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:187
#: cce1a70fe1cb472dad4274f6f069a6fe
msgid ""
"**H4 Citations resolve.** Pass. The new function's `file:line` resolves."
msgstr "**H4 引用可解析。** 通过。新函数的 `file:line` 能解析成功。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:189
#: 4399a26cf547441393ee15e1f5fb0593
msgid "**H5 Links resolve.** Pass."
msgstr "**H5 链接可解析。** 通过。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:190
#: b6e3bfe2832044babf337cabfd55b9d4
msgid "**H6 Excerpts provenance.** Pass."
msgstr "**H6 excerpt 出处可验证。** 通过。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:191
#: c375542e42cf4de0821bce4b256c44b1
msgid ""
"**H7 No `[TODO]` in published pages.** **FAIL.** The `<!-- TODO -->` marker "
"is in a page with `status: published`."
msgstr ""
"**H7 已发布页面不得含 `[TODO]`。** **失败。** `<!-- TODO -->` 标记出现在了一个 `status: "
"published` 的页面里。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:194
#: 28b9aa3d5dcc4969860ce008084360f5
msgid ""
"The gate blocks publish. The reviewer sees a single-line failure and a "
"pointer to line 47 of the diff. Cost of the check: a grep across "
"`content/**/*.md` that finished in 30 ms. Cost of having skipped the check: "
"a production KB that publishes a page whose diagram says \"TODO\", which a "
"user sees and loses a small amount of trust over. That trust does not come "
"back for free."
msgstr ""
"门禁阻止了发布。评审者看到的是一行失败信息 + 一个指向 diff 第 47 行的指针。本次检查的成本：对 `content/**/*.md` 的一次 "
"grep，在 30 ms 内完成。跳过这次检查的成本：线上知识库发布了一个图示写着“TODO”的页面 —— "
"有用户看到了，对它的信任感轻微折损。这种折损不会自己免费恢复。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:201
#: 9d1167da7e124299b1e64dbe70083280
msgid "Example"
msgstr "Example —— 范例"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:203
#: a984e0f248e44b2b9b07b37b472dcf9d
msgid "A full gate run from a real Friday-afternoon PR (numbers anonymised):"
msgstr "一次真实周五下午 PR 上的完整门禁跑动（数据已匿名化）："

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:232
#: c68e492586da4420a742fafb20261428
msgid ""
"The author sees three specific things to fix, not a 400-file review queue. "
"Fixing them takes perhaps ten minutes: one page's `reviewed_by` field gets "
"filled in, one citation gets updated to the new line number, one broken "
"`file:line` gets repointed to the file that replaced `cmd/sync/main.go`. Re-"
"run the gates: all pass. Publish proceeds."
msgstr ""
"作者看到的是三件具体要修的事，而不是一份 400 个文件的评审队列。修完这三件大约花 10 分钟：一个页面的 `reviewed_by` "
"字段被补上，一条引用被更新到新的行号，一条坏掉的 `file:line` 被重新指向替代 `cmd/sync/main.go` "
"的那个文件。重跑门禁：全部通过。发布继续。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:239
#: 5848182a276640c89ecef7978a12fc90
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "Conclusion —— 小结"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:241
#: 5297a67f65c6418a941b7d67e133eade
msgid ""
"Evaluation (IR metrics, faithfulness scores) tells you whether the KB is "
"useful once published. Gating (hard and soft checks) tells you whether this "
"specific build is publishable at all. Both are mechanical. Both are cheap. "
"Both are refused by most KBs today, because adding them requires committing "
"to the four corners of Chapter 7a — if the footer is not there, H1 cannot "
"run; if the operational model does not resolve citations, H4 cannot run."
msgstr ""
"评测（IR 指标、faithfulness 分数）告诉你：知识库一旦发布出去是否有用。门禁（硬 / "
"软检查）告诉你：这一次具体构建是否根本就“可以发”。两者都是机械的，都很便宜。但今天大多数知识库两者都拒绝上 —— 因为要加它们，就得对第 7a "
"章那四个角落做出承诺：footer 不在，H1 就跑不起来；运维模型不解析引用，H4 就跑不起来。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:249
#: fe808e2927994c11909cdaa180e803c2
msgid ""
"The next chapter closes the loop: when a hard gate fails or a soft gate "
"warns, *what does the fix look like?* The answer is the three-level update "
"strategy (C3), the actual mechanics of which have been previewed here but "
"belong to Chapter 16."
msgstr ""
"下一章把整条回路闭合：当硬门禁失败、或软门禁告警时， * 修复到底长什么样？ * 答案就是三级更新策略（C3）—— "
"它的真正机制在本章已经先铺了一下，但正经讲述属于第 16 章。"

#: ../../part4-operations-lifecycle/ch15-evaluation-and-benchmarks.md:254
